  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness（DSH）插件：**提示词优化** + **语音输入增强** —— 把输入框草稿改写得更清晰、可执行，并给语音输入加上热键、说完自动停、清口水词与纠错。\n\n草稿常常只有半句要求，交给模型后还要来回补问——点一下 ✨ 就地改写，不满意可撤回；语音则直接说，停顿即停，结果落回输入框。\n\n[](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/releases) [](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/stargazers) [](LICENSE) [](docs/compatibility-matrix.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer   # 更新\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer   # 卸载\n```\n\n也可以从 GitHub 指定 tag 安装：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer#v3.5.1\n```\n\n装完（或更新 / 卸载后）重启 DSH，输入框工具行出现 ✨ 即安装成功。需本机已装 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) **≥ 0.2.1-rc.1** 且 `pnpm` 在 PATH 中。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能做什么",
      "text": "**提示词优化**\n\n- ✨ **一键优化** — 改写当前草稿，可继续优化、可撤回、优化中可取消\n- **5 种模式** — 基础 / 轻量 / 标准 / 专家 / 一键发布\n- **记忆开关** — 发送前的多轮优化累积为记忆链，发送即清空（默认关）\n- **模型链** — 多个模型按序尝试，可增删改序、开关思考、行内测连通性\n\n**语音输入增强**（识别由 DSH 官方 `speechToText` 提供；插件不自带识别引擎、不下载模型）\n\n- **两种入口** — 官方 🎤 按钮，或插件热键（点按开始 / 再按停止；长按 = 按住说、松开停）\n- **静音监测** — 说完自动停，判定时长 1–5 秒可调（默认 2 秒），可整体关闭\n- **清口水词** — 本地规则清理语气词 / 重复 / 拖音，不改写、不新增（默认开）\n- **语音纠错** — 识别完成后做字词层订正，仅作用于语音路径（默认关）\n- **自动增强** — 识别结果填入草稿后自动触发增强（默认关）\n\n按钮与文案跟随 DSH 界面语言（中文 / English）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "设置项速查",
      "text": "设置 →「提示词增强」，改动即时保存：\n\n| 位置 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| 模型配置 | 模型链；语音识别：热键、静音监测（1–5 秒）、清口水词、语音纠错、自动增强 |\n| 优化参数 | 优化模式、模板、记忆开关、上下文预算、超时 / 回复长度 / 输出上限 |\n\n录音采集、识别与写回都由 DSH 官方语音控件完成，插件只叠加上述增值。录音不落盘。\n\n[Releases](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/releases) · [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) · [兼容性说明](docs/compatibility-matrix.md) · Licensed under [Apache-2.0](LICENSE)\n\n> 隐私：插件不记录、不上报任何数据；增强结果来自外部 LLM，发送前请自行核对。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer",
      "text": "A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin: **prompt optimization** + **voice input enhancement** — rewrites a composer draft into something clearer and more actionable, and adds a hotkey, stop-on-silence, filler removal and correction to voice input.\n\nA draft is often half a requirement, so the model asks again — click ✨ and it is rewritten in place, undoable. With voice, just speak; it stops on a pause and the transcript lands back in the composer."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer",
      "text": "[](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/releases) [](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/stargazers) [](LICENSE) [](docs/compatibility-matrix.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer\ndsh plugin --profile web update dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer   # update\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer   # remove\n```\n\nOr install a specific tag from GitHub:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer#v3.5.1\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Restart DSH afterwards (also after updating or removing) — the ✨ button appears in the composer toolbar. Requires [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) **≥ 0.2.1-rc.1** installed locally and `pnpm` in PATH."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "**Prompt optimization**\n\n- ✨ **One-click optimize** — rewrite the current draft; keep refining, undo, or cancel while optimizing\n- **5 modes** — Basic / Lite / Standard / Expert / One-click Publish\n- **Memory switch** — pre-send rounds accumulate into a memory chain, cleared on send (off by default)\n- **Model chain** — try models in order, add/remove/reorder, toggle thinking, test connectivity inline"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "**Voice input enhancement** (transcription is provided by DSH's official `speechToText`; the plugin ships no engine and downloads no models)"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- **Two entry points** — the official 🎤 button, or the plugin hotkey (tap to start / tap to stop; long-press = hold to talk, release to stop)\n- **Stop on silence** — auto-stop with a configurable 1-5 s silence window (default 2 s), can be turned off entirely\n- **Filler removal** — local rule-based cleanup of filler words / repeats / drawn-out sounds; no rewriting, no additions (on by default)\n- **Transcript correction** — word-level fixes after transcription, voice path only (off by default)\n- **Auto-enhance** — trigger enhancement automatically once the transcript is in the draft (off by default)"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "Buttons and text follow the DSH interface language (中文 / English)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings at a glance",
      "text": "Settings → \"Prompt Enhancer\"; changes save immediately:\n\n| Where | What |\n|---|---|\n| Model chain | Model chain; Voice input: hotkey, stop-on-silence (1-5 s), filler removal, transcript correction, auto-enhance |\n| Optimization | Mode, template, memory switch, context budget, timeout / reply length / output limit |\n\nCapture, transcription and writing back are all handled by DSH's official voice control — the plugin only adds the value-adds above. Audio is not written to disk."
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings at a glance",
      "text": "[Releases](https://github.com/Fishsb/dsh-voice-prompt-enhancer/releases) · [CHANGELOG](CHANGELOG.md) · [Compatibility notes](docs/compatibility-matrix.md) · Licensed under [Apache-2.0](LICENSE)\n\n> Privacy: the plugin records and reports nothing; enhanced results come from an external LLM — verify before sending."
    }
  ],
